1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,570
The iris keeps its own hour.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,770
Winter. Nothing happens, and that is the work.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,630
Iris is the Greek word for rainbow.

4
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:19,830
She watches. She waits.

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,100
Then, in its season, the bud splits.

6
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:41,430
And she looks up.

7
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:49,030
The iris hour.
